---
import AboutCard from "./AboutCard.astro";
---

<div class="z-10">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full lg:w-3/4 xl:w-5/8">
    <div
      class="about-title-2 text-center text-2xl font-bold text-shadow-lg md:text-4xl"
    >
      More About Me
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex min-h-100 flex-col gap-8 max-lg:mx-8 md:flex-row">
      <AboutCard icon="flag">
        I like learning cyber security knowledge through playing Capture The
        Flag competitions. Usually I play Binary Exploitation (Pwn) challenges,
        but I also enjoy exploring other categories.
      </AboutCard>
      <AboutCard icon="vim">
        I develop side projects in my free time. I use Zed Editor with Vim
        keybindings as my primary text editor because Vim keybindings is the
        best workflow in development history.
      </AboutCard>
      <AboutCard icon="game">
        When I need a break, I like to play video games. I'm a huge fan of the
        Pokemon franchise, and I also enjoy other games, usually the MMORPG or
        story rich games that interest me.
      </AboutCard>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
